<outcomestext name="Outcomes">
<![CDATA[
<h2>Learning Outcomes</h2>
<p>Upon successful completion of the program, graduates will:</p>
<ol>
	<li>Learn fundamentals of computer science theory and practice in order to contribute to industry, academic, and government activities.</li>
	<li>Learn modern design and development techniques.</li>
	<li>Enhance their base of knowledge with appropriate electives.</li>
	<li>Develop laboratory and software skills for advanced project development and research activity.</li>
</ol>
